          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4a6109e0f30e846e8341dec7e6ad184029ec0fd8",
          "message": "perf(runtime): remove per-object debugger bookkeeping allocation (#1069)\n\n* perf(runtime): share object inspection bounds with detached property storage\n\n* test(runtime): benchmark callback traversal alongside object iterators\n\n* test(runtime): check released values in indexed and direct object storage\n\n* perf(runtime): keep singleton fields inline and avoid boxing callback keys\n\n* test(runtime): cover removal during bounded callback traversal\n\n* perf(runtime): inline map visitors and use typed string fingerprints\n\n* perf(runtime): co-allocate bounded slots and skip known-missing keys\n\n* perf(runtime): specialize native string property reads\n\n* docs(runtime): record object ownership and benchmark comparisons\n\n* perf(runtime): use native dictionaries for fast-object growth\n\nMove the dictionary threshold into the shape cache and transition fast objects to native runtime dictionaries, reusing their ownership, paging, copy, clone, and iteration behavior. Update VM cache wiring and add dictionary hit and miss benchmarks.\n\nFix object copy and clone handling, preserve nil values in hashes, and strengthen tests for key storage release, fingerprint collisions, dictionary semantics, and encoded integer types. Make JSON and MessagePack object decode benchmarks use deterministic wire data, and update debugger ownership and performance documentation.\n\n* perf(runtime): use Go maps above eight native object fields\n\n* perf(vm): reuse the resolved slot on shape overwrites\n\n* ci: link the full unit benchmark comparison from pull requests\n\n* docs(runtime): record the final four-way object storage qualification\n\n* fix(vm): preserve object lookup and hash semantics across callbacks and VMs\n\n* ci: collect five independent samples for each main benchmark baseline\n\n* docs(runtime): record corrected mutation and VM read qualification",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-27T11:37:32-05:00",
